sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Engineer
  participant GH as GitHub (main)
  participant T as CI · tests
  participant B as CI · build + deploy
  participant R as Image registry
  participant V as Secrets vault<br/>opened only for the deploy window
  participant S as Staging cluster
  participant O as Release owner
  participant P as Production cluster
  participant N as Backup storage

  E->>GH: merge PR → main (docs-only commits skipped)
  GH->>T: full backend + frontend suites · deployed-code coverage gates
  GH->>B: build all service images in parallel
  B->>R: push release tag (write-once)
  T-->>GH: green
  GH->>B: deploy-stage (protected environment)
  B->>V: short-lived credentials → secrets map
  B->>S: wake shared services · state backup · terraform apply · migration job · health check · re-apply autoscaling
  Note over GH,S: minutes from merge to staging
  O->>GH: deploy-prod release_tag=<tag> (manual promotion)
  GH->>V: open vault for the window
  GH->>B: guard · verify tag · fetch secrets
  B->>N: blocking database backup (deploy fails if it fails)
  B->>P: render config · state backup · terraform apply · migration job
  B->>P: health check · smoke test · search-engine ping
  alt failure
    B->>P: roll back to previous release
  end
  GH->>V: close vault
  Note over O,P: approval gate with a time limit · production lags main until promoted
